{"id":"u-079d9876-2fa6-440a-9628-abbf95b950f9","src":"community","title":"Rugby in-season program","author":"Paul S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ua5Paf-rugby-in-season","desc":"Maintain strength during rugby season. No cardio sessions included as rugby practice and drills should provide enough. All rep changes are meant to go off of what/how you're feeling on a given day. If you're sore, go lighter. If you're feeling fresh, go heavier. It's meant to give a small framework of mandatory minimum of exercises that shouldn't take more than an hour.\n\nYou can replace the pullovers with other exercises but I've found the pullover is a solid upper body exercise. \n\nAlso, I add in dips at least one day a week if I have time. You can replace the pullover with dips. Can also swap rows for pullups, pendlay rows, t bar, etc. Just hit your major areas minimum twice a week regardless of the exercise or angle.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:04:28.258Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Kettlebell Complex","Recover"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio","sets":[{"sec":300,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":2,"hi":6,"pct":85,"x":5}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":2,"hi":6,"pct":85,"x":5}]},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":6,"x":5}]},{"n":"Band twist","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":6,"x":5}]},{"n":"Total Gym Ab Machine","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":6,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio","sets":[{"sec":300,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"Trap Bar Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":2,"hi":6,"pct":85,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":6},{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":7},{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":7.5},{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"r":6,"r